OL,3,GNEWSAMurder probe into 'remarkable'
OL,4,Aman's death closed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA murder investigation into the death
OL,7,Fof a "remarkable" Worcestershire man
OL,8,Fhas been closed with nobody charged.
OL,10,FPaul Hart, 52, was injured on Belle Vue
OL,11,FTerrace, Malvern, on 12 July 2025 and
OL,12,Flater died at Worcestershire Royal
OL,13,FHospital.
OL,15,FThree men, aged 18, 20 and 25, were
OL,16,Farrested last year on suspicion of
OL,17,Fmurder but police have now confirmed no
OL,18,Ffurther action will be taken.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
