OL,3,GNEWSAMurder probe into 'remarkable'
OL,4,Aman's death closed
OL,5,
OL,6,F"A file of evidence was passed to the
OL,7,FCrown Prosecution Service who have
OL,8,Fadvised there will be no further action
OL,9,Fand the investigation has been closed,"
OL,10,Fa force spokesperson said.
